Description: Provide mstpd-pvst-filter-support
 libvyatta-bridge-perl depends on it. The DANOS mstpd packaging provided it;
 NuDanOS builds mstpd with Debian's packaging and keeps the PVST filter
 patch (patches/mstpd/0020-pvst-filter.patch).

--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 Package: mstpd
 Architecture: linux-any
 Depends: iproute2, python3, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
+Provides: mstpd-pvst-filter-support
 Description: user-space STP/RSTP/MSTP daemon for Linux bridges
  mstpd is a user-space daemon that replaces the spanning-tree handling
  built into the Linux kernel bridge. It implements STP (IEEE 802.1D),
